Content-Type: application/json

{"idempotencyKey":"mock-render-via-jobs-001","kind":"render","request":{"runId":"{{runId}}","revision":{{revision}},"platform":"wechat","selectedTitleIndex":0,"templateId":"wechat-editorial","deliveryId":"{{deliveryId}}","visualMode":"canva"}}

### Canva状态：configured/connected仅是配置与授权，不代表完整设计验收
