POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/canva/connect
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### OAuth callback由Canva自动重定向，不在此保留code/state样例，不手工重放
# GET /api/integrations/canva/callback?... → 成功302 /#workbench
# 门户精确登记：http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/integrations/canva/callback
# 当前官方远程MCP：https://api.canva.com/connect/v1/mcp

